 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "P24-01",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "heading",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    320,
    172,
    910,
    308
   ],
   "text": "El sistema esquelètic",
   "crop_sha256": "e2aa0b785fc1ee0ad8186cdd783f8a23e507a930571d492860c6f743f45ce650"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-02",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "map",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    350,
    262,
    1355,
    423
   ],
   "text": "OSSOS · ARTICULACIONS · ESQUELET",
   "crop_sha256": "4b158b6dcf7d223fca1db21daa92a6bd5fdc139821d7bb8522854dcb60f64a4d"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-03",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    260,
    387,
    1185,
    503
   ],
   "text": "L’aparell locomotor permet el moviment del nostre cos.",
   "crop_sha256": "e7a8120bc3b6e74da5fbcd16aa19d388b09734a313d335c1aee4985f0b28c787"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-04",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    260,
    387,
    1185,
    543
   ],
   "text": "Està format pel sistema esquelètic i el sistema muscular.",
   "crop_sha256": "e375073f0c7e20f911fcb0f0522764b455c9db4dcf4d1e143e322b4ce6a4c301"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-05",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    255,
    487,
    1185,
    593
   ],
   "text": "El sistema esquelètic el formen els ossos, que componen l’esquelet.",
   "crop_sha256": "7c3ddf42329e148313308cd5f1cfa41992de6faf7a521d19311d1c67112da8b3"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-06",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    255,
    527,
    1185,
    673
   ],
   "text": "Aquest sistema intervé en el moviment del cos, dona forma i suporta el pes del cos, protegeix dels cops els òrgans interns...",
   "crop_sha256": "8bdcf6aecf6a7b9a6fa1653a2ec4d58ac0af3a22e9c6027f56db55c6893ac005"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-07",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "heading",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    250,
    672,
    460,
    778
   ],
   "text": "Els ossos",
   "crop_sha256": "354a1c5ceb3465d7c61f5cd035b01bf0b071e09bffbcd33548b2a86652fc354e"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-08",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    245,
    737,
    970,
    843
   ],
   "text": "Els ossos són òrgans rígids i resistents.",
   "crop_sha256": "474bbf3f3b4307ec3bdb0b3c6b403ff318976e69b3fe43aca85baaba78582ee6"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-09",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    245,
    737,
    970,
    883
   ],
   "text": "Tots els ossos del cos formen l’esquelet.",
   "crop_sha256": "7e5f0289b895256adb8b446d8d4eda35536340eef02ec0c18567dcf2ff253b3d"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-10",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    240,
    777,
    1065,
    923
   ],
   "text": "Tot i el seu aspecte rígid, els ossos són òrgans vius que creixen i necessiten nutrients.",
   "crop_sha256": "3c93fee6b2fd56962ff398f0239b36058ef4ae001aa968cad0cd7863ea6642d1"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-11",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    235,
    867,
    595,
    978
   ],
   "text": "Tenim tres tipus d’ossos.",
   "crop_sha256": "6d71130fec22c0f19b27038b5cf30f612b2b8d1b477162b11d52eb91a30e7578"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-12",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "label",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    1094,
    664,
    1586,
    971
   ],
   "text": "Ossos llargs, com els de les extremitats.",
   "crop_sha256": "0f59f6767d1eedbe97d36f35d74b9163296f65ddf22caac3fb7dd2166fdc9a09"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-13",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "label",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    264,
    979,
    676,
    1286
   ],
   "text": "Ossos curts, com les vèrtebres que formen la columna vertebral.",
   "crop_sha256": "18be80d3b3fc5a655e4beeafb38e17d1b166519190d1f326beec739c024054e4"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-14",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "label",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    714,
    1034,
    1576,
    1366
   ],
   "text": "Ossos plans, com els que formen el crani.",
   "crop_sha256": "d45ff7c9f760da9a7367b700edd7143ffc529dd5e973ba3172385b9e63ead2f2"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-15",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "heading",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    210,
    1287,
    595,
    1403
   ],
   "text": "Les articulacions",
   "crop_sha256": "6e4357ec03bc752df1b8acf8dbf2edfed109c4fd4dba09d490b60aa2bdd76990"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-16",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    200,
    1377,
    1195,
    1493
   ],
   "text": "Els ossos de l’esquelet s’uneixen entre si mitjançant les articulacions.",
   "crop_sha256": "90d2761212cd8e2ecdb991c4286c7f9961f5716c09e8472f350bf6805da93972"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-17",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    200,
    1397,
    1165,
    1543
   ],
   "text": "En algunes articulacions, com les del crani, els ossos estan tan units que semblen només un.",
   "crop_sha256": "3060b91882edbbccef782464a51b53495697fd00fbd15c1276c138b75b22f407"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-18",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    525,
    1457,
    950,
    1563
   ],
   "text": "Són articulacions immòbils.",
   "crop_sha256": "2815d156f05560d8ecab236089ee5c2cb8d8216cd025f2d380f7d177d9cb0c52"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-19",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    190,
    1467,
    1115,
    1623
   ],
   "text": "En d’altres, els ossos es poden moure, com passa al colze, al coll o al genoll.",
   "crop_sha256": "87229d9082680c241dd0b597b33f749b5e928589d95d341af849dc3362e5b11d"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-20",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    185,
    1557,
    565,
    1673
   ],
   "text": "Són articulacions mòbils.",
   "crop_sha256": "5fbadc05f3682f6b287fe40d504f500fc79ab194a31eecfba6224f13c0c5c3fe"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-21",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "fig",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    344,
    1564,
    1536,
    2046
   ],
   "text": "[dibuix] nen estirat: 3 cercles grocs (genolls i colze; color de «mòbils») i 1 cercle blau al crani (color de «immòbils»).",
   "crop_sha256": "97717b9200d477a65324975c129f26099377138a5ef5abefeb6ee651bb9927d4"
  },
  {
   "id": "P24-22",
   "page": 24,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    150,
    1937,
    1255,
    2123
   ],
   "text": "En les articulacions mòbils, els ossos estan units mitjançant els lligaments.",
   "crop_sha256": "aa0b86175212bd5d28aebeba21c3dbfab83a2e238ae6b64e701f8fda537f06c8"
  },
  {
   "id": "P25-01",
   "page": 25,
   "kind": "heading",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    145,
    217,
    385,
    323
   ],
   "text": "L’esquelet",
   "crop_sha256": "d28b996768c04533c0d1bf070fadc4395a3e0fbe26e442dce4ab581c0e6c0b18"
  },
  {
   "id": "P25-02",
   "page": 25,
   "kind": "text",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    140,
    287,
    690,
    458
   ],
   "text": "El nostre esquelet està format per més de 200 ossos distribuïts pel cos en tres zones.",
   "crop_sha256": "80e29b6b34d2cd2fb8d32749f55533738ba308d81bd8fa4a12be0da6ef4e7887"
  },
  {
   "id": "P25-03",
   "page": 25,
   "kind": "box",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    144,
    464,
    576,
    726
   ],
   "text": "Cap. Hi tenim els ossos del crani i els de la cara.",
   "crop_sha256": "8ddb3dfba364441a92c02905fe9cadee60b0b38ab571df5850fbea6fcfabff7a"
  },
  {
   "id": "P25-04",
   "page": 25,
   "kind": "box",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    144,
    464,
    576,
    726
   ],
   "text": "Els ossos del crani són plans i tenen la funció de protegir el cervell.",
   "crop_sha256": "8ddb3dfba364441a92c02905fe9cadee60b0b38ab571df5850fbea6fcfabff7a"
  },
  {
   "id": "P25-05",
   "page": 25,
   "kind": "box",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    134,
    764,
    641,
    1066
   ],
   "text": "Tronc. Hi tenim la columna vertebral, que està formada per les vèrtebres i protegeix la medul·la espinal.",
   "crop_sha256": "2eebe196cb1947651ed13970df5ce88420baa6cc5e33471a6f672d1dd7823101"
  },
  {
   "id": "P25-06",
   "page": 25,
   "kind": "box",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    134,
    764,
    641,
    1066
   ],
   "text": "La columna vertebral, les costelles i l’estern protegeixen el cor i els pulmons.",
   "crop_sha256": "2eebe196cb1947651ed13970df5ce88420baa6cc5e33471a6f672d1dd7823101"
  },
  {
   "id": "P25-07",
   "page": 25,
   "kind": "box",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    129,
    1104,
    636,
    1346
   ],
   "text": "Extremitats. Hi tenim ossos llargs, com l’húmer i el fèmur.",
   "crop_sha256": "ed969afa3f0fb54a226985efb5a265166807b55cc7ad7168e1e35b050ef44417"
  },
  {
   "id": "P25-08",
   "page": 25,
   "kind": "box",
   "bbox_upload_px": [
    129,
    1104,
    636,
    1346
   ],
   "text": "A les mans i als peus tenim molts ossos petits, les falanges.",
   "crop_sha256": "ed969afa3f0fb54a226985efb5a265166807b55cc7ad7168e1e35b050ef44417"
  },
  {
